<title>UK: EU sugar import levies.</title>
<headline>EU sugar import levies.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>EU sugar representative prices and additional duties on imports effective June 4.</p>
<p>			 Representative price    Additional duty</p>
<p>			 (Ecus per 100 kg net)   (Ecus per 100 kg net)</p>
<p>			   New	 Prev	   New	  Prev</p>
<p> Raw cane sugar     24.77     24.07	  3.91-9.15  4.26-9.50</p>
<p> Raw beet sugar     24.77     24.07	  3.72-8.72  4.07-9.07</p>
<p> Coloured sugar     28.44     27.41	 11.01	11.53</p>
<p> White sugar	  28.44     27.41	  6.49	 7.01</p>
<p> Other syrups	  0.28	0.27	  0.37	 0.38</p>
</text>
